WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.653
Every child has a spark, but not every child gets the chance to show it.

2
00:00:04.703 --> 00:00:06.200
This is GranthAI.

3
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:10.444
In Sanskrit, granth means a book, and its root means to tie together.

4
00:00:10.494 --> 00:00:15.428
That's what we do: we tie learning, people and opportunity together, around every child.

5
00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:24.735
In Ireland, only fifty-four percent of children in care complete the Leaving Cert, against eighty-seven percent of all children.

6
00:00:24.785 --> 00:00:31.555
Teachers in DEIS schools do remarkable work, but one teacher can't sit beside twenty-five children every evening.

7
00:00:32.917 --> 00:00:34.467
It starts with a profile.

8
00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:35.694
Aoife is nine.

9
00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:38.916
She picks what she loves: football, space and drawing.

10
00:00:38.966 --> 00:00:44.746
She chooses her language, her teacher confirms consent, and GranthAI starts learning how she learns.

11
00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:47.373
Here's the difference.

12
00:00:47.423 --> 00:00:51.258
Aoife asks a general chatbot: what's three quarters plus a half?

13
00:00:51.308 --> 00:00:52.952
It hands her the full answer.

14
00:00:53.002 --> 00:00:55.085
She copies it, and learns nothing.

15
00:00:55.135 --> 00:00:58.656
In GranthAI, she tries first, and answers four sixths.

16
00:00:58.706 --> 00:01:03.290
GranthAI spots the exact mistake: she added the tops and the bottoms.

17
00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:08.232
So it shows her a picture, gives one hint at a time, and she finds five quarters herself.

18
00:01:09.583 --> 00:01:15.813
Behind every reply, a Bayesian model tracks what she has mastered, what she's forgetting, and what to review next.

19
00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:24.755
To keep her motivated, her feed follows her interests: why a football curves, a rocket to build this weekend, a book she'll love.

20
00:01:24.805 --> 00:01:31.055
Gentle check-ins let her share how she feels, and if something is wrong, GranthAI never keeps secrets.

21
00:01:31.105 --> 00:01:33.313
It connects her with a trusted adult at school.

22
00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:35.904
Then it gets bigger.

23
00:01:35.954 --> 00:01:41.892
Our ranking and clustering algorithms find children with the same passions across different schools.

24
00:01:41.942 --> 00:01:47.445
Aoife and three pupils from two other DEIS schools form a space club, and build a project together.

25
00:01:48.783 --> 00:01:55.399
Each group is matched with a vetted retired teacher as a mentor, by subject, availability and language.

26
00:01:55.449 --> 00:02:00.042
Children gain role models, and retired teachers gain meaningful, paid work.

27
00:02:01.383 --> 00:02:03.085
Teachers get their time back.

28
00:02:03.135 --> 00:02:10.993
The class dashboard shows which misconceptions are spreading, suggests a ten-minute mini lesson, and flags who might need a quiet word.

29
00:02:11.043 --> 00:02:17.214
It even helps plan outdoor activities, because principals told us their pupils need safe places to play.

30
00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:23.431
Future Me turns interests into real routes, from CAO courses to apprenticeships.

31
00:02:24.783 --> 00:02:32.637
And it's safe by design: no ads, no selling data, no emotion detection, and built for GDPR and the EU AI Act.

32
00:02:33.983 --> 00:02:35.134
GranthAI.

33
00:02:35.184 --> 00:02:38.691
Not another chatbot, but a whole team around every child.

34
00:02:38.741 --> 00:02:42.637
Starting in Ireland's DEIS schools, and growing across the UK and Europe.

